# Lazav, Wearer of Faces: "a creature card exiled with it". Over two attacks it exiles the Ornithopter (turn 3) and then the
# Lightning Bolt card (turn 5). Sacrificing a Clue offers only the creature card: the Bolt cannot be chosen (a refusal), the
# Ornithopter can, and Lazav becomes a 0/2 Ornithopter. (Both cards stay exiled with it.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Lazav, Wearer of Faces
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lazav, Wearer of Faces.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Lazav, Wearer of Faces > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Ornithopter
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Lazav, Wearer of Faces > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Lightning Bolt; Ornithopter
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Clue Token.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Lazav, Wearer of Faces = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot2.Life = 16
